  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Band Intro/Japan talk**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Sam K to the stage**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Bobby Bird**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Tuesday Night Squad**: back after 25 archived shows (961 days) [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Soulive2008-08-16.NT4.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 71 min; rated 1.67/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Basshound and the Higher Hands opened the night; their full sets are available separately on Archive.org [1]\n- The taper left early because they weren't feeling the show, not for any technical or security reason [3]\n- This listener also attended, found the show underwhelming, and blamed a subdued, rather dull crowd [4]\n- The commenter, from New Orleans, is used to far livelier, drunker, dancing crowds than this Baltimore one [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Soulive2008-08-16.NT4.flac24**: taped by mike at soundbetter dot net; transferred by mike at soundbetter dot net; source: Rode NT4 > PCM-D50 @ 24/48 [1]. Also: The recording is incomplete: the taper left early, so the audio fades out before the show ends; The taper notes that the shortened recording fits on a single CD; The taper recorded over an hour of Soulive and uploaded it to Archive [1][3]",
